="8" class="no-bookings">No rooms have been added yet.</td></tr>@endforelse</tbody></table></div></section></main></div><script>document.querySelectorAll('[data-until]').forEach(timer=>{const target=new Date(timer.dataset.until).getTime(),label=timer.querySelector('.timer-countdown');const tick=()=>{const seconds=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((target-Date.now())/1000));if(!seconds){label.textContent='Timer complete — refreshing…';setTimeout(()=>location.reload(),800);return}const h=Math.floor(seconds/3600),m=Math.floor(seconds%3600/60),s=seconds%60;label.textContent=`${h}h ${String(m).padStart(2,'0')}m ${String(s).padStart(2,'0')}s remaining`;setTimeout(tick,1000)};tick()});</script></body></html>
